---
title: Sequence Diagram - Customer places an order
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant MS as MenuScreen
    participant MC as MenuItemCard (memo)
    participant CC as CartContext / cartReducer
    participant CS as CartScreen
    participant OS as OrderSummaryScreen
    participant OC as OrdersContext / ordersReducer
    participant AS as AsyncStorage
    participant OT as OrderTrackingScreen

    C->>MC: Tap "+ Add to Cart"
    MC->>MS: onAddToCart(item) (useCallback)
    MS->>CC: dispatch({ type: ADD_ITEM, payload: item })
    CC-->>MS: new cart state (items, quantity)
    CC-->>C: Cart tab badge shows item count

    C->>CS: Open Cart tab
    C->>CS: Edit quantity / note, enter "WELCOME10"
    CS->>CC: dispatch(INCREMENT / UPDATE_NOTE / APPLY_PROMO)
    CC-->>CS: updated items, promoCode, discountPercent
    C->>CS: Choose Dine-in + Table 3 (useState)
    C->>CS: Tap "Review order"
    alt no table / pickup time selected
        CS-->>C: Inline error "Choose the table you are sitting at."
    else valid
        CS->>OS: navigate("OrderSummary", { orderType, tableId, pickupTime })
    end

    OS->>OS: useMemo(calculateTotals(items, discountPercent))
    OS-->>C: Subtotal, discount, 5% service, 15% tax, grand total
    C->>OS: Tap "Place order"
    OS->>OC: placeOrder({ user, items, totals, type, tableId })
    OC->>OC: dispatch(PLACE_ORDER) -> status "Pending", timestamp
    OC-)AS: useEffect: setItem("@restaurant/orders", orders)
    OS->>CC: dispatch({ type: CLEAR_CART })
    OS->>OT: navigate("OrdersTab" > "OrderTracking", { orderId })

    OT->>OT: useEffect: setInterval(1 s) clock + status timer
    loop every second until Served
        OT-->>C: Step indicator + elapsed mm:ss
        opt elapsed >= 10 s / 20 s / 30 s
            OT->>OC: updateStatus(id, Preparing / Ready / Served)
            OC-)AS: persist updated order
        end
    end
    OT->>OT: cleanup: clearInterval() on unmount / final status
